{
  "mcpServers": {
    "mcd-mcp": {
      "type": "streamablehttp",
      "url": "https://mcp.mcd.cn",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer ${MCD_MCP_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  },
  "_说明": [
    "本文件为脱敏示例，仅使用环境变量占位符，不含任何真实 Token。",
    "申请 Token：https://open.mcd.cn/mcp （手机号登录 → 控制台 → 激活）",
    "运行前：export MCD_MCP_TOKEN=你的Token",
    "切勿将真实 Token 提交进版本库。"
  ]
}
